flowchart TD
    BASELINE[Capture device baseline] --> IMPLEMENT[Implement one controlled change]
    IMPLEMENT --> POSITIVE[Run positive tests]
    POSITIVE --> NEGATIVE[Run malformed and negative tests]
    NEGATIVE --> OBSERVE[Capture UART, memory, debug, and timing evidence]
    OBSERVE --> RESTORE[Restore target]
    RESTORE --> COMPARE[Verify restored state]
    COMPARE --> DOCUMENT[Document result and residual uncertainty]
